    {
      "text": "those who believe not will receive eternal damnation, D&C 29:44 (68:9). disobedient shall be damned, D&C 42:60 (68:9; 84:74; 112:29). he that receives not the Son shall be damned, D&C 49:5. he that does not anything until he is commanded is damned, D&C 58:29. he that is not baptized shall be damned, D&C 112:29. those who discomfort the Lord’s people shall not escape damnation, D&C 121:23. he that does not abide covenant will be damned, D&C 132:4. those who commit blasphemy against the Holy Ghost shall be damned, D&C 132:27.",
